# Project Context — AML Automation

## What the project does

AI-DLC pipeline that reads Excel (.xlsx) or .docx test case documents and generates Playwright tests. Targets the AML application at `https://kadelamldev.customerxps.com:2506`. **Session login is enabled on 2506** via Clari5 Command Center (`/clari5-cc/login`) using `EMAIL` / `PASSWORD` in `.env` (default user `QAUSER2`). Unauthenticated / RBAC Excel cases stay Partial unless `QA_INCLUDE_AUTH_CASES=1`. **4-Eyes Maker-Checker is live:** Save / Create / Edit / Delete-Deactivate / Activate pend until Checker approval; Current vs Proposed Value and Business Justification rules apply globally — see `.cursor/rules/maker-checker-4eyes-mandatory.mdc` and `docs/reference/maker-checker-4eyes-approval.png`. **Audit Trail is live:** every action is logged under Administration → Audit Trail / Audit Log (list + View Changes / DATA STATE CHANGE) — see `.cursor/rules/audit-trail-mandatory.mdc` and `docs/reference/audit-trail-list.png`, `docs/reference/audit-trail-view-changes.png`.

