### Milestone projects (auto-discovered)

`playwright.config.ts` creates a `<milestone>-chromium` project for every `tests/milestoneN/` folder. Adding `milestone3` requires no config change.

| Env | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
| `PW_MILESTONE_WORKERS` | Worker count for all milestone projects (`PW_MILESTONE1_WORKERS` still works) |
| `PW_MILESTONES` | Optional filter, e.g. `1,2` or `milestone1,milestone2` |
| `PW_HEADLESS` / `HEADLESS` | Headless mode for milestone projects |

